Title:          flatpak.tcz
Description:    system for sandboxed desktop applications on linux
Version:        1.16.1
Author:         see list of sites below
Original-site:  see list of sites below
Copying-policy: see list of sites below
Size:		3.2M
Extension_by:   gnuser
Tags:           flatpak appimage snap portable
Comments:       ----------
                Notes:
                1. The  noembed  boot code is required
                2. ~/.local/share/flatpak directory contains your installed
                   apps and should be persistent (or a link to a persistent
                   directory) for your installed apps to survive a reboot
                ----------
                Usage example:
                $ sudo /usr/local/etc/init.d/dbus start # may not be needed
                $ flatpak --user remote-add flathub https://flathub.org/repo/flathub.flatpakrepo
                $ flatpak --user install flathub org.kde.kcalc
                $ flatpak --user run org.kde.kcalc
